; Four six-second pages of the same bilingual dialogue: fourteen events stay on screen together.
; Compare the static first page with the animated ones; the third page only animates for 300 ms.

; --- page 1: static baseline
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Small,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,24)}1/4 static baseline - the same fourteen lines with nothing animated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,70)}今晚的月色真美，我们沿着河边慢慢走回家吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Latin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,116)}The moon looks lovely tonight, let us walk home by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,162)}这条字幕用来测试动画标签对每一帧的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Latin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,208)}This line checks how animation tags affect every frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,254)}颜色渐变不会改变文字的宽度和换行位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Latin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,300)}A color fade never changes the width or the line breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,346)}双语字幕在动画作品中非常常见，也很密集。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Latin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,392)}Bilingual subtitles are common in anime, and often dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,438)}请留意画面是否流畅，以及是否出现卡顿。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Latin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,484)}Watch whether playback stays smooth or starts to stutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,530)}每一行都同时动画化，就像繁忙的对话场景。
